{
  "about": "The source files of lean_mpas by group, in compile order, read by tools/lean/config.py. Sources are paths or {path, when} entries, included only when that global define is set. Paths are relative to the repo root; the original MPAS files come from third_party/mpas-8.4.2/src. A file listed in two groups is compiled once, in its first group (tools/lean/config.py compile_units).",
